        "schema:url": "https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/marine-trackline-geophysical-data",
        "schema:name": "Marine Geophysical Trackline Data Homepage",
        "schema:description": "NCEI's Marine Trackline Geophysical database provides access to bathymetry, magnetics, gravity and seismic reflection data collected during marine cruises from 1939 to the present. Coverage is worldwide. Data sources include both US and non-US oceanographic institutions, universities, and government agencies."
      }
    }
  ],
